## Import

Import existing resource

### Using Import block (terraform v1.5.0 and later)
```terraform
import {
  to = stackguardian_workflow_git.example
  id = "workflow-group-id/workflow-id"
}
```

### Using CLI
```bash
terraform import stackguardian_workflow_git.example workflow-group-id/workflow-id
```
